### Open Source Anatomy Model References & Attribution

The runtime mesh (`public/models/human_body.glb`) is a **project-modified unisex muscular derivative** baked with `npm run bake:body` from `human_body.original.glb`. It is not a purchased commercial Sketchfab store asset.

This project references and draws inspiration from open-source anatomical datasets and 3D human anatomy projects:

1. **Z-Anatomy Atlas Project**:
   - Website: https://www.z-anatomy.com/
   - Reference Sketchfab Model: https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/myology-31b40fd809b14665b93773936d67c52c
   - License: Creative Commons Attribution (CC BY-SA 4.0)

2. **BodyParts3D / Anatomography**:
   - DBCLS, Licensed under CC BY-SA 2.1 Japan
   - URL: https://dbarchive.biosciencedbc.jp/en/bodyparts3d/
